OL,3,GNEWSAHosepipe ban 'ridiculous' while
OL,4,Apipes are leaking
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents have criticised Thames Water
OL,7,Ffor leaving a water leak unrepaired
OL,8,Fduring a hosepipe ban.
OL,10,FThe burst pipe in Chester Street,
OL,11,FReading, has been seeping water for
OL,12,Fseveral weeks, according to people
OL,13,Fliving there.
OL,15,FJan Kollar said it was "ridiculous" the
OL,16,Fcompany was preventing him from
OL,17,Fwatering his flowers while leaks were
OL,18,Fnot being fixed promptly.
OL,20,FA spokesperson for Thames Water said:
OL,21,F"We're aware of this leak and will fix
OL,22,Fit as soon as possible."
